{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4dce103e89cee166a3c7dc2e41d8f39cace49f1de45d841a2cc2b8f21af76d27", "ja": "情熱的に、わがままに", "zh": "热情、任性地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "820b674f3037dc9c37f4991801be03adc543b534c16323b624cc596e96cd81e2", "ja": "公演を翌日に控えた最終調整。メンバー達は\n互いに一歩も譲らず、ダンスで我欲をぶつけ\n合う。普段は周囲に気を遣ってばかりの4人\nが強い情熱をさらけ出した姿に、プロデュー\nサーは公演の成功を確信するのだった！", "zh": "演出前一天进行最后调整。成员们\n互不相让，在舞蹈中碰撞着各自的欲望。\n平时总是顾虑周围人的4人\n展现出强烈热情的模样，让制作人确信演出\n一定会成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "546a036f0618fb715ad9810291cc97c02bbf2c4fc7501ec460a0452050801f79", "ja": "（『chicAAmor』の公演をいよいよ明日に控え、\n今日は最終調整。みんなの出来栄えは……？）", "zh": "（《chicAAmor》的公演终于要在明天举行了，今天进行最后的调整。大家的表现如何呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "43f8919dd07219c1faedc5f3cee997e4ac1ddb67809c0ee7c1715ef851c64161", "ja": "……ここで、フィニッシュ。\n{$P$}、どうでしたか。", "zh": "……到此，结束。\n{$P$}先生，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "d843f4b468cb49519d78022986cdae0d44f6dc11edc0ad7f86e206d71e2f849c", "ja": "……？\nあの、{$P$}……？", "zh": "……？\n那个，{$P$}……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f82615e13b3622ac713c03760d8abeb4d65fad549268bde6ea6a5261c0043372", "ja": "……。あっ！　すまんすまん！　\nいや、その……つい見とれてしまったよ。それで……。", "zh": "……啊！抱歉抱歉！\n那个……不知不觉看入迷了。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1783173eedb0434f6d51756ebd16d732f91df97dead23237abbde4229b97aa74", "ja": "風花が、ダンスの全体の雰囲気や\nペースを作ってくれた感じかな？", "zh": "感觉是风花帮忙营造了舞蹈整体的氛围和节奏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2e172526431f02ae2be4e656b1258b1e57a87ee3b14d7652fb7794db4050c624", "ja": "はい、私なりにですけど。みんながもっと、\nわがままに、自由に、動きやすいように……。", "zh": "嗯，虽然只是以我的方式。希望大家能更任性、更自由、更轻松地行动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4c277701e5a492e2505819b7d2d7642b6a3c7337edceabd2aa59d6bdee4fc42", "ja": "でも、できたのは千鶴ちゃんのおかげです。\n自信をもって、思いきって決めることができました♪", "zh": "不过，之所以能做到这些，都是多亏了千鹤。让我能够充满自信、果断地做出决定♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "c403d52144685607cfe8d9194d8f2fd5047f761be7392e949a30af9481b41022", "ja": "風花はわたくし達の様子を把握してくれていますもの。\nこれ以上の適任者はいませんわ。", "zh": "风花很了解我们的情况嘛。没有比她更合适的人选了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "23c33772aeadb565cd1e431087774a0b51c913990f872d5577708d563f14e92e", "ja": "そうか……助かったよ、風花。それと、ジュリアの\nステップのキレも、前よりずいぶんよくなった感じだ。", "zh": "这样啊……帮大忙了，风花。另外，茱莉亚的舞步利落程度，感觉也比之前好多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "88620e86c704d1aa0b0675d91a4145ca79204338aafbf7300f2163e794aced11", "ja": "完璧とまでは言わないが、あたしもベストを\n尽くしてるぜ。本番はもっと期待してくれ。", "zh": "虽然还谈不上完美，不过我也全力以赴了。\n正式演出时你就尽管多期待一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "045514095849114fea2511de26ee0579477b8e28d146b071234dcc76a0f87647", "ja": "もちろん、あたしだけじゃない。ウチら全員、\n心から燃えてきてるんだ……！　なあ、サヨ！", "zh": "当然，不仅是我。我们所有人，\n都从心底燃起来了……！对吧，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "fefca6ecc1e46700444d9e0f37bf27cac0df531a8fc9cce74f8af902c61120d3", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}、私……負けません！\n明日は私が一番、情熱の炎を燃やしてみせます！", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}，我……不会输的！\n明天我一定会让自己的热情之火燃烧到最旺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "42f99e026784b80584dc39a65b6813f614f7a97bb0da09d80dad8f967ce85704", "ja": "（紗代子……！？）", "zh": "（纱代子……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "d680b27fb87b87632cc8b2bb25ec57c850d4cf37a38eba47b462af43c7fb98d9", "ja": "絶対、みんなを夢中にさせてみせます！\n私の激しい、情熱で！！", "zh": "我绝对会让大家都为之着迷的！\n用我炽烈的热情！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "027a8186776db85977b856977f1e397c77d8c1a0fecb5da5a9aa254b4b783c16", "ja": "言ったな？　だけど、あたしも譲る気はないね。\n客席の目は全部、あたしの情熱にクギ付けだ！", "zh": "你说了算？不过，我也不打算让步。\n台下所有人的目光，都会被我的热情牢牢钉住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "4786bb97391bf5169dfa800641d3a6052d598253dba5be7d14189d1c10e45caf", "ja": "あら、わたくしも舞台の上では容赦いたしませんわよ？\nセレブの情熱の渦に、全て巻き込んでみせますわ！", "zh": "哎呀，我在舞台上也不会手下留情哦？\n我会让所有人都卷入名媛热情的漩涡中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9b83c14ef653f2bd957452a7ed783b87eb9c9f5f377e5de54406ac567a1db68f", "ja": "今回は、私も決めたの。私の情熱を捧げる代わりに、\nお客さんの情熱を全部もらおうって！！", "zh": "这次，我也下定决心了。作为献上我的热情的交换，\n我要把观众们的热情全部收下！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "28a9b2f5fcf82bd31ec2f659f393e344e84c9e128d61b26c7ef9d1f8f3ee0d42", "ja": "（全員が全員、目の色が変わっている！\nここまで強引で、わがままなことを言えるなんて……）", "zh": "（所有人都变了眼神！竟然能说出这么强硬、这么任性的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "44410dc582ab7da7468e354e3c9ccac0c7bc83ee7c62d227af35194de2e406fa", "ja": "（あ、そうか。自分がこの4人を選んだ理由が、やっと\nわかった気がする。あの直感は思い付きではなく……）", "zh": "（啊，原来如此。我好像终于明白，自己为什么会选中这4个人了。那份直觉并不是一时兴起，而是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "fc3388b6ba0029cae725373a3d91af513d729260f0e82786bf064297539d1349", "ja": "{$P$}も、見ていてくださいね。\n私たち、思いっきりぶつけます。今の気持ちを、全部！", "zh": "{$P$}也请看着吧。\n我们会毫无保留地倾注一切。把当下的这份心情，全部释放出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1329ed4f8348aa8026e3433b3aae5f68786636a617026b0457e24e346f2f57ca", "ja": "『chicAAmor』にしかできないステージに……。\n全部をぶつけるステージにしてみせます！", "zh": "呈现只有『chicAAmor』才能做到的舞台……\n我们一定会让它成为全力倾注所有的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8f934172762c5baa53231ef0015b90df412836bc7be7cf9d34faa20eb631c120", "ja": "ああ、人目を気にせず、さらけだしてくれ。\n客席を巻き込んで、情熱渦巻くステージを頼む！", "zh": "啊，不用顾忌他人的目光，尽情展现出来吧。\n把观众席也卷进来，拜托你们带来一场激情涌动的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "fbe0052192093fb5d9f8baa5a19cf7bba5408304d9e3c142d8535b50a34ddc20", "ja": "バイラモス！！", "zh": "Bailamos！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fbe0052192093fb5d9f8baa5a19cf7bba5408304d9e3c142d8535b50a34ddc20", "ja": "バイラモス！！", "zh": "Bailamos！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "fbe0052192093fb5d9f8baa5a19cf7bba5408304d9e3c142d8535b50a34ddc20", "ja": "バイラモス！！", "zh": "Bailamos！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "fbe0052192093fb5d9f8baa5a19cf7bba5408304d9e3c142d8535b50a34ddc20", "ja": "バイラモス！！", "zh": "Bailamos！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "58f9d44716a239dd662cc57260cd0d405be81fb72742acbf02fa70861883bef5", "ja": "（そう……この4人はなんだかんだと、\n周りの人を慮ってしまう……そういう4人なんだ）", "zh": "（没错……这4个人总是会为身边的人着想……是那种4人啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0204_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "9ba2e475e08d811b71d74b7a6653c3b1e8b75f070c7ceac6853030d6f02735af", "ja": "（だからこそ……\nそれが反転した時の輝きは、きっと……！）", "zh": "（正因为如此……\n当这一切反转时绽放出的光芒，一定会……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
